.TH PCRE2_GET_PARENS_NEST_LIMIT 3 "11 September 2026" "PCRE2 10.49-DEV"
.SH NAME
PCRE2 - Perl-compatible regular expressions (revised API)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.rs
.sp
.B #include <pcre2.h>
.PP
.nf
.B int pcre2_get_parens_nest_limit(pcre2_compile_context *\fIccontext\fP,
.B "  uint32_t *\fIvalue\fP);"
.fi
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.rs
.sp
This function gets the parens nest limit field in a compile context. The result is
zero in case of success and PCRE2_ERROR_NULL in case of a null pointer.
.P
There is a complete description of the PCRE2 native API in the
.\" HREF
\fBpcre2api\fP
.\"
page and a description of the POSIX API in the
.\" HREF
\fBpcre2posix\fP
.\"
page.
